{"id":"u-868b9175-90bf-4c13-a283-8faaac7b93a9","src":"community","title":"UNBROKEN METHOD 3.0","author":"Bohdan K.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/EJ8XEF-unbroken","desc":"UNBROKEN METHOD 3.0 is a science-based 8-week full-body program designed for people who want to build real-world strength, improve body composition, and create an athletic physique without unnecessary volume.\n\nThe program combines heavy compound lifts with carefully selected accessory work to maximize muscle growth while improving posture, core stability, and long-term joint health.\n\nUnlike traditional bodybuilding routines, this method prioritizes functional strength, balanced muscular development, and movement quality.\n\nEvery session focuses on:\n\n• increasing overall strength\n\n• building lean muscle\n\n• improving posture and shoulder health\n\n• strengthening the glutes and posterior chain for lower back protection\n\n• developing a strong, stable core\n\n• maintaining athletic performance while reducing body fat through proper nutrition\n\nWhether your goal is to look better, feel stronger, or move pain-free for years to come, UNBROKEN METHOD 3.0 provides a sustainable path to long-term progress. Train hard. Recover well. Stay Unbroken.\n\n\n“Train for life, not just for the mirror.”","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-08-02T19:34:28.615Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Posterior Chain Strength","Lower Body Power","Athletic Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3},{"r":0}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":